        "content": "Transformaci\u00f3n Digital Enterprise\n\nNEGOCIO: CRM + ERPNext + Stripe \u2192 Automatizaci\u00f3n\nCOMUNICACI\u00d3N: Teams + Slack + WhatsApp + Twilio\nANALYTICS: Dashboard + KPIs + Predicci\u00f3n\nINNOVACI\u00d3N: GitHub + Notion + CI/CD",
